<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχᾰλάω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rejoice, exult</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχαλόωσι . .
				Ἀχαιοί, κτλ</span>. <i>rejoice</i> because a Trojan
			champion has been chosen for his looks, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.43
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχαλόων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.514
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				10.565
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχαλόωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					23.1
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχαλάασκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.996
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπακτὴρ καγχαλῶν ἀγρεύματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					109
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καγχαλάασκον ἐτώσια μητιόωντι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					8.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνὶ φρεσὶ -όωντες κρύβδ᾽ Ἥρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.136
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				200
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				4.377
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>H.</u>
				5.234
			</span></i>; of hounds, deer, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.523
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.237
			</span></i>; of pards, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ μέγα
			-όωσι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.80
			</span></i>; of a polypus, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.281
			</span></i>.</div>
